  "plan": "1) Run ./orig to regenerate high_res.ppm and reconstructed.ppm. 2) Compare reconstructed.ppm with image.ppm (md5sum). If identical, I'll know image.ppm is exactly ffmpeg's downsample of orig's render. Then I'll reverse-engineer the scene primitives from high_res.ppm/image.ppm and reimplement in C.",
